{"id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-soundness.md","title":"GL Soundness Theorem","display":"thm-gl-soundness — GL Soundness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-soundness","aliases":["89-thm-gl-soundness"],"display":"thm-gl-soundness — GL Soundness Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-validity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-soundness — GL Soundness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50df0572bbd651eb\" href=\"?note=50df0572bbd651eb\" title=\"89-df-gl-validity\">89-df-gl-validity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}.\\]</div><button class=\"e